  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The list of minor military conflicts within the universe of the <a href=\"/wiki/Second_Renaissance_Wikia\" title=\"Second Renaissance Wikia\">Second Renaissance</a>.   \n</p>\n<table class=\"article-table\" style=\"width: auto;\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th scope=\"col\">Conflict\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Year(s)\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 150px;\">Side 1\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 150px;\">Side 2\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Result\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"new\" title=\"User:SolaceEaSw/ManchurianRebellions (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVXNlcjpTb2xhY2VFYVN3L01hbmNodXJpYW5SZWJlbGxpb25zP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Manchurian Rebellions</span>\n</td>\n<td>2057-2065\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>Manchuria</li></ul>\n<hr />\n<ul><li>Japan</li>\n<li>Mongolia</li>\n<li>Mongol Republic</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>China</li></ul>\n<hr />\n<ul><li>United States</li>\n<li>Korea</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Sino-Allied Victory\n<ul><li>Manchurian rebellions suppressed</li>\n<li>Re-institution of Manchuria into China</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/User:SolaceEaSw/ArabianAssyrianWar\" title=\"User:SolaceEaSw/ArabianAssyrianWar\">Arabian-Assyrian War</a>\n</td>\n<td>2064-2071\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/b/be/Flag_of_Assyria.png/revision/latest?cb=20171205011925\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Flag of Assyria\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/b/be/Flag_of_Assyria.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20171205011925\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Flag of Assyria.png\" data-image-key=\"Flag_of_Assyria.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span> Assyria</li>\n<li><span