-renaissance/images/0/0e/Flag_of_Aden-0.png/revision/latest?cb=20171205011653\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Flag of Aden-0\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"17\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Flag of Aden-0.png\" data-image-key=\"Flag_of_Aden-0.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/0/0e/Flag_of_Aden-0.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20171205011653\" /></a></span> Aden</li>\n<li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/7/7e/Flag_of_Oman.png/revision/latest?cb=20171205011711\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Flag of Oman\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Flag of Oman.png\" data-image-key=\"Flag_of_Oman.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/7/7e/Flag_of_Oman.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20171205011711\" /></a></span> Oman</li>\n<li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/61/Flag_of_Qatar.png/revision/latest?cb=20171205011728\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Flag of Qatar\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"10\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Flag of Qatar.png\" data-image-key=\"Flag_of_Qatar.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/61/Flag_of_Qatar.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20171205011728\" /></a></span> Qatar</li>\n<li><span typeof=